 R←Test_GoToGitHub_002(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;rc;msg;stop;cfgFilename
⍝ Exercise ]GitHub.GoToGitHub without specifying an owner (should use the default owner)
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 :If batchFlag
     R←T._NoBatchTest
     :Return
 :EndIf

 cfgFilename←##.GitHub.GetConfigFilename
 'Create!'##.GitHub.FilesAndDirs.CheckPath ##.GitHub.GetPathToConfig
 (⊂'{owner: "aplteam",}')⎕NPUT cfgFilename

 CommTools.Pause'This test needs you: it will open the homepage of the Test Repo on GitHub'

 stop←0
 (rc msg)←2↑stop UCMD'GoToGitHub ''TestRepo'''
 →T.GoToTidyUp rc≠0

 :If 1 CommTools.YesOrNo'Did https://github.com/aplteam/TestRepo open in your default browser?'
     R←T._OK
 :EndIf

∆TidyUp:
 {}##.GitHub.FilesAndDirs.DeleteFile cfgFilename
⍝Done
